&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1198&quot; data-local-id=&quot;635cc91c8e1f&quot;&gt;Experience shipping technical platform products, with the seniority to lead work across multiple engineering teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1317&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7f50a2944594&quot;&gt;Real technical depth in how AI inference works, including model serving, distributed systems and production infrastructure. You think problems through yourself rather than relying on engineers to define them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1529&quot; data-local-id=&quot;31410d89334a&quot;&gt;Strong communication and expectations management across engineering, research, sales, support and leadership. You write crisp PRDs, RFCs and release notes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1688&quot; data-local-id=&quot;eb3a4d3203ac&quot;&gt;B2B/enterprise experience with technical buyers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1740&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cbb4752491c6&quot;&gt;Comfort with ambiguity and shifting scope.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
