&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/nebius/senior-technical-product-manager-token-factory-berlin-34449","tags":["Token Factory-NP"],"job_types":[],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1793116520},{"slug":"remote-senior-account-executive-americas-281211","company_name":"Hopae","title":"Senior Account Executive - Americas","description":"<h2>🌍 <strong>About Hopae</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">At <strong>Hopae</strong>, we're building the world's most trusted digital identity platform — private, secure, and built for real life. We believe identity should be in your control — not locked behind outdated systems or centralized gatekeepers.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our product, Hopae Connect, lets businesses verify real people across borders through a single API — no need to build country-by-country integrations themselves. Our technology powers instant, privacy-first verification across fintech, credentials, supply chain, and gaming — for IDV providers, e-signature platforms, and enterprises who need identity to just work, everywhere.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Backed by top global investors, Hopae operates across <strong>Seoul, Paris, Luxembourg, and San Francisco</strong>, bringing together exceptional talent from over 10 nationalities. We move fast, think globally, and build products that define the future of identity.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>💡 Why You’ll Love It Here</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Global DNA:</strong> Work with exceptional peers across Seoul, Paris, and San Francisco</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>High Impact:</strong> Build technology shaping the global trust and identity landscape</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Ownership Culture:</strong> No micromanagement — full trust, full accountability</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Elite Standards:</strong> Work fast, learn fast, and grow with world-class peers</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Inclusive &amp; Respectful:</strong> 10+ nationalities, diverse perspectives, one vision</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Growth Mindset:</strong> Access mentorship, leadership visibility, and continuous learning</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em><strong>This position is open only for candidates based in the US &amp; LATAM</strong></em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">🎯 <strong>What You'll Do</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">The Americas is where Hopae’s next wave of growth gets built. The US, Brazil, Mexico and</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Argentina are live on Hopae Connect, and demand is coming from three directions at once: IDV providers adding government eID coverage, eSignature platforms facing new compliance deadlines, and regulated industries that need to verify real people across borders. </p><p style="min-height:1.5em">As Senior Account Executive, Americas, you own that territory end to end. You are accountable to revenue, not activity.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• <strong>Own the full cycle</strong>. First conversation to signed contract: qualification, technical discovery, commercial structuring, negotiation, and close. No handoffs to hide behind.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• <strong>Sell across all three of our buyer types.</strong> IDV’s, eSignature providers, and medium to large regulated industry players. You will learn to move between a platform integration conversation and a bank compliance conversation in the same week.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• <strong>Sell the recurring motion, not just the one-time check.</strong> Our strongest accounts use eID verification for ongoing login and session assurance, not a single onboarding event. Building that story into every deal is a core part of the job.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• <strong>Work direct and through resellers</strong>. A meaningful share of Americas revenue arrives through resellers whose own customers are the real relying party. You will also sell directly to large platform companies that need ID verification in many countries. (banks, casinos, crypto, ride share, etc.)</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• <strong>Partner with BDR and Marketing on pipeline</strong>. You will inherit a researched target list and a BDR to work with, and you are expected to self-source alongside it.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• <strong>Run a credible technical sale</strong>. Work directly with Engineering and Product on integration scoping, sandbox evaluations, and production testing, so deals close on substance rather</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">than enthusiasm.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• <strong>Keep the forecast honest.</strong> Clean HubSpot hygiene, real stage discipline, and a number you stand behind. We would rather hear bad news early than good news that does not land.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• <strong>Be the voice of the Americas internally.</strong> Which countries, rails and use cases you keep hearing about should shape what Hopae builds and where it goes next.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">🧠 <strong>Who You Are</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• <strong>Experience:</strong> 6 to 8 years in B2B SaaS or API and infrastructure sales, with at least 3 years carrying a full-cycle quota on complex, multi-stakeholder deals. You have closed deals where legal, security and compliance all had a veto.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• <strong>Market:</strong> Background in identity, KYC and AML, payments, fintech infrastructure, or reg tech. You understand why verifying a person in Brazil is a different problem from verifying one in Denmark.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• <strong>Technical Credibility:</strong> Comfortable with API-first products. You can read documentation, run a discovery call with engineers in the room, and scope an integration without needing a solutions engineer on every call.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• <strong>Territory &amp; Language:</strong> Based in the Americas, with real coverage experience across the US and Latin America. Fluent in English is required; Spanish and/or Portuguese are a significant advantage for the LatAm side of the territory, but not required.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• <strong>Commercial Range:</strong> Equally at home selling direct to an enterprise and selling through a reseller or platform partner, including deals where your customer’s customer is the one who actually needs the verification.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• <strong>How You Work:</strong> Outcome-driven and self-directed. You set your own targets based on quota, hold yourself to them, and operate well across time zones in an async, global team.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• <strong>Bonus:</strong> Experience with LatAm identity rails (INE, CPF, CNH, RENAPER), regulated-industry selling, or the eIDAS 2.0 and EUDI Wallet landscape.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>⚡️ <strong>Fast Facts</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">💰 <strong>$13.5M+ raised</strong> from top global investors</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">📦 <strong>2.6M+ downloads</strong> of our sd-jwt-js library</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">🌍 <strong>10+ nationalities</strong> across 3 hubs</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">🔬 <strong>82 eID research projects</strong> completed</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">🌐 <strong>3 projects accepted</strong> into the OpenWallet Foundation</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>🎁 <strong>Benefits &amp; Culture</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Unlimited PTO</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Remote-friendly work model</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Real ownership from Day 1</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">High-impact, global product</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Multicultural, respectful team</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>🧭 Interview Process</h2><ol style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Recruiter Intro Call (30 min) – Get to know Hopae</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Functional or Technical Interview (45 min) – Dive into your skills</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Culture Fit Conversation (45 min) – Collaboration &amp; alignment</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Offer 🎉</p></li></ol><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>Note: The process may vary slightly depending on the role.</em></p><h2></h2><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/hopae/remote-senior-account-executive-americas-281211","tags":["Revenue"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Remote","created_at":1793115642},{"slug":"learning-experience-architect-gilching-183637","company_name":"Quantum-Systems GmbH","title":"Learning Experience Architect (m/f/d)","description":"<h4><strong>About the role:</strong></h4><p style="text-align:justify;">As a Learning Experience Architect at Quantum Systems, you will work with our Training &amp; Demo Team to shape learning around our unmanned systems (UxS). You will help our international customers and employees understand complex technology and use it safely.</p><p style="text-align:justify;">You will define the instructional approach for our training portfolio and support its implementation. Working with trainers and subject matter experts, you will digitize and scale existing training and develop new offerings. You will combine digital learning with practical exercises and assess how well learners can apply what they have learned.</p><p style="text-align:justify;">You will have the freedom to take your ideas from concept to launch and put your own stamp on UxS training at Quantum Systems. Your work will improve the technical and instructional quality of our training and make its impact measurable.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:justify;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong>What is your Day to Day Mission:</strong></h4><ul><li><p>You will design modular learning paths that combine digital self-study with instructor-led training and simulator exercises.</p></li><li><p>You will turn technical expertise into interactive learning modules and assessments and coordinate media production.</p></li><li><p>You will build scalable offerings in learning management systems such as Moodle and define standards for quality and reusable content.</p></li><li><p>You will test learning concepts with target users and improve them using feedback, usage data and learning results.</p></li><li><p>You will evaluate learning outcomes and practical application and use the findings to improve our training portfolio.</p></li><li><p>You will advise and support our trainers in using effective instructional methods for digital and blended learning.</p></li><li><p>You will prioritize portfolio improvements and deliver learning projects with UxS experts, the Simulator Team and external providers.</p></li><li><p>You will analyze learning needs and define measurable objectives for new and existing offerings with the Training &amp; Demo Team.</p></li></ul> <br> <h4><strong><br></strong></h4><h4><strong>What you bring to the team:</strong><br></h4><ul><li><p>You have a degree in education, instructional design, media or e-learning, or a comparable qualification with relevant practical experience.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>You have solid experience in adult learning and modular, digital and blended learning, demonstrated through project examples or a portfolio.</p></li><li><p>You can analyze learning needs, define measurable objectives and test learning concepts with target users.</p></li><li><p>You are proficient in authoring tools and experienced in designing and publishing digital learning in learning management systems such as Moodle.</p></li><li><p>You know how to evaluate learning outcomes and practical application and use feedback and learning data to drive improvements.</p></li><li><p>You can understand complex technical topics, explain them clearly with subject matter experts and advise trainers on new learning formats.</p></li><li><p>You work independently and methodically and coordinate learning projects with different stakeholders.</p></li><li><p>You have excellent written and spoken German and English communication skills.</p></li><li><p>Experience with AI in learning, media design (images, audio, video) or learning management system administration is a plus.</p></li></ul><p><br></p><h4><strong>Why Quantum-Systems:</strong></h4><ul><li><p>We believe in the power of combined&nbsp;efforts: straightforward tech expertise&nbsp;paired with a customer-centric focus.</p></li><li><p>We are industry pioneers&nbsp;who are ambitious, bold,&nbsp;and visionary. </p></li><li><p>We push limits, think&nbsp;outside-the-box and strive&nbsp;for technological excellence to&nbsp;shape the future of aerial data.</p></li><li><p>We promise to be your runway&nbsp;for individual and professional&nbsp;growth.</p></li></ul><p><strong><br></strong></p><h4><strong>Our benefits:</strong></h4><ul><li><p><strong>Company pension scheme: </strong>We support you so that you can already make provisions for later.</p></li><li><p><strong>Flexible working hours: </strong>With trust-based working hours, you are not only responsible for your working hours, but also for your work-life balance.</p></li><li><p><strong>Mobile Work:</strong> If things get a little busy in the office, you have the option to work remotely one flexible day per week to create the right balance.</p></li><li><p><strong>Stay active:</strong> With EGYM Wellpass, you get access to thousands of fitness and sports facilities — and of course, we subsidize the membership.</p></li><li><p><strong>Bike-Leasing: </strong>We support you in staying environmentally mobile and healthy.</p></li><li><p><strong>Corporate Benefits: </strong>Your opportunity for attractive offers and discounts from well-known suppliers and brands, e.g. Adidas, Apple, Expedia.</p></li><li><p><strong>Employee events: </strong>We not only want to grow together, but also celebrate our successes together.</p></li><li><p><strong>Lunch-Card: </strong>Be powerful with delicious energy, daily lunch budget is sponsored.</p></li><li><p><strong>Company Shuttle:</strong> Enjoy our convenient shuttle service that picks you up from Laim in Munich and brings you to our location, with return trips at the end of the workday.</p></li></ul><p><br></p><h4><strong>About us:</strong></h4><p><strong>Quantum Systems is a leading European deep-tech company for unmanned systems across air, land and maritime domains.</strong> We develop and scale integrated hardware, software and AI-powered solutions for mission-critical operations.</p><p>At Quantum Systems, you’ll work alongside experts across disciplines, take ownership from day one and help turn ambitious ideas into technology with real-world impact. We move fast, think beyond boundaries and give our teams the space to shape what comes next.</p><p><strong>The Future is Unmanned - But the responsibility is not.</strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><figure><iframe height="281" width="500" src="//www.youtube.com/embed/r-M8k0smtII"></iframe></figure><p><br></p><h4><strong>Our commitment:</strong></h4><p>We are an open-minded company that not only values diversity, but actively promotes it. Regardless of gender, age, ethnic origin, religion, sexual orientation or disability, we firmly believe that the diversity of our employees is an essential part of our success.</p><p>At our company, every voice is heard and every perspective is valued. We believe that our differences enrich us and help us to find creative solutions and generate innovative ideas. We pride ourselves on creating an inclusive work environment where all employees can reach their full potential.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/quantum-systems-gmbh/learning-experience-architect-gilching-183637","tags":["Customer Success","Support & Training"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Gilching, Bayern, Germany","created_at":1793115078},{"slug":"remote-seo-specialist-berlin-428615","company_name":"TransPerfect","title":"SEO Specialist","description":"<p><strong>&nbsp;Ready to turn SEO into measurable business growth?</strong></p><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;">TransPerfect are looking for a strategic, data-driven SEO Specialist to support their digital department to help global brands expand into the German market. </p> <br> <p>We're looking for a freelance expert to support businesses expanding into German markets. You'll work on a range of SEO and digital visibility projects, helping brands improve their performance across both traditional search engines and emerging AI-powered platforms.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Project types include:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Technical SEO Audits</p></li><li><p>LLM Visibility Audits</p></li><li><p>Core Web Vitals, Hreflang &amp; Canonical Reviews</p></li><li><p>Content Strategy &amp; Optimisation</p></li><li><p>Technical SEO Consulting</p></li><li><p>AI Prompt Development</p></li><li><p>Website Crawls &amp; SEO Analysis</p></li><li><p>Keyword research and optimisation</p></li><