gh our virtual share option plan (VSOP).</p></li><li><p>You grow with us. As the company grows, your role grows with it.</p></li><li><p>Real influence. You decide how we build software, and you shape the engineering team we build.</p></li><li><p>A competitive salary.</p></li><li><p>A product that matters: a medical device for real clinics, built together with clinicians and lab staff.</p></li><li><p>Flexible hours and office days. We work from Berlin and meet in person regularly, up to several days a week. This isn't a fully remote role.</p></li><li><p>English is our working language. German isn't required.</p></li><li><p>We sponsor the EU Blue Card if you're moving to Berlin.</p></li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/ferto-health-gmbh/founding-ios-engineer-berlin-395151","tags":["Software Development"],"job_types":["Permanent employment (unbefristeter arbeitsvertrag)","professional / experienced"],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1793107859},{"slug":"vp-sales-f-md-berlin-68736","company_name":"Clariness GmbH","title":"VP Sales (f/md/)","description":"<p><strong>Clariness is looking for a VP Sales (f/md/) based in US.<br>- Full-time; unlimited -</strong></p><p><strong>About the role:</strong></p><p>Clariness helps patients access clinical trials faster through our ClinLife® platform, active in 50+ countries. In this role, you will turn expertise into real-world impact, connecting patients with studies and accelerating medical breakthroughs. Make your next role matter - help more patients join life-changing studies.</p><p><strong><br>As a VP Sales, you would be responsible for:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Prospecting, developing, and closing new business opportunities within the biotechnology, pharmaceutical, medical device, and CRO sectors.</p></li><li><p>Growing and managing strategic and existing customer accoun