loyee lifecycle and take on increasing responsibility as you develop.</span></p></li></ul> <br> <ul><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">3+ years of experience</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> in HR, People Operations, or a similar role.</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Ownership &amp; initiative:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> You take responsibility, follow things through, and proactively solve problems rather than waiting to be told what to do.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Fast learner &amp; hands-on mindset:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> You pick up new topics quickly, enjoy figuring things out, and are happy to jump into different areas and take on new responsibilities.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Reliable &amp; detail-oriented:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> You’re highly organized and precise, especially when working with employee data, contracts, payroll, and other sensitive information.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Strong communication skills:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> You’re approachable, responsive, and comfortable working in a fast paced international environment</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Fluent German and strong English</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">, both written and spoken are required.</span></p></li></ul><h3><strong><span style="color:#121317">Why TYTAN?</span></strong></h3><ul><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Build technology with real operational impact:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> Develop autonomous defense systems designed to protect lives and strengthen Europe’s security</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Shape scalable defense capabilities:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> Work on solutions built for mass deployment, cost efficiency, resilience, a