e="min-height:1.5em">Strong production systems background - you've built and scaled things that matter, and you’ve done something <em>hard</em> and lived to tell the tale</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven experience in distributed systems</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience operating autonomously in small, high-velocity environments - ideally in a startup</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience working in a data-focused company or closely alongside a data engineering/ML team - data is core to what we're building at Kernel, and you will play a key role in shaping how we grow that capability</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Nice-to-Have:</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Scaled an engineering team through a growth phase (5 → 20+ engineers), or from Series A to Series C</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Technical depth across the stack: NodeJS, Postgres, TypeScript, Kubernetes AI-driven or data-heavy product experience</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Understanding of LLMs (e.g., RAG, prompt engineering, evals)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">CRM data models or workflow automation knowledge</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hands-on Data Engineering or ML Engineering experience - as data becomes an increasingly large part of what we do, this would be a great asset for us to have</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>⚠️ This role may not be for you if you:</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Insist on shipping pixel-perfect code</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Prefer managing from a distance without technical involvement</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Need extensive process and structure before making decisions</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>❌ This role is definitely not for you:</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">If you o