ing a protocol.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You write clearly in English.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">No technical background needed, but personal experience using AI tools like ChatGPT or Claude will help.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Why join</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Meaningful work.</strong> Help shape something that could change how mental health support works for millions of people. Every morning the team sees messages from people calling Ash "life changing."</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Your judgement, not a checklist.</strong> We think what sets great practitioners apart matters more than any single protocol. We want your view, including where it differs from others'.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Flexible and remote.</strong> Fits around your clinical work.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>How it works</strong></h2><ol style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Apply (about 2 minutes).</strong> Share your LinkedIn or a professional profile.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>We read every application,</strong> on a rolling basis.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>If you're shortlisted for the first group, we'll be in touch by Friday 6 November about next steps,</strong> including a paid sample task of about an hour.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Join the group.</strong> You'll work 5–20 hours a week, on your own schedule. $100–140/hour in the US or £70–100/hour in the UK, based on experience.</p></li></ol><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>All conversations are anonymised before review. Some touch on emotionally difficult topics, including risk. This is a freelance contractor role, with no employee benefits.</em></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</