>unique culture</u></strong></a>. We already partner with 40K+ companies of all sizes, serving more than 1M+ members, and have reached €800M+ in ARR.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Prevention as the new norm. That's what we're building with our team of 1000+ people. If it speaks to you: we're hiring across France, Spain, Belgium, and Canada. And beyond.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>⭐️<strong> The Insurance Team </strong>⭐️</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Being part of Alan's insurance community is a great opportunity to have a significant impact on people's health and wellbeing in our multiple countries of operation. </p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>We are at the heart of Alan’s mission</strong>, bringing to the team our technical leadership and expertise on healthcare and death &amp; disability insurance. </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">We work hand in hand with our data scientists, designers, engineers and product managers to build the most differentiating products and <strong>provide a delightful experience at a fair price.</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>We build and manage offers</strong> for large companies and public institutions with our sales and account management teams. </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>We make sure our portfolio is closely monitored</strong> and risks are effectively managed. </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>We also manage our capital, steer our reinsurance strategy</strong> and maintain a trusting relationship with our insurance regulators.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>⭐️<strong> Your role </strong>⭐️ </h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">On both Health and Prevoyance businesses, you will:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Define and build the metrics, tools, and dynamic analytics<strong> </strong>to <strong>monitor our portfolio and forecast our margin</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the quantitative metrics computation to bring added-value to <strong>strategic decision makings</strong> (portfolio repricing) alongside Strategy and Finance teams</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Understand the <strong>margin and claims drivers</strong> on both gross and ceded business for repricing and offer guarantee adjustments (claims analytics)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Contribute to the <strong>reinsurance</strong> plans and support the renewal strategy in liaison with the Risk team</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support entities in new countries to define and build their own portfolio monitoring and forecasts</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>⭐️<strong> Is it you we’re looking for? </strong>⭐️ </h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">You would be a good fit if you:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Have at least 2 years of experience in insurance and portfolio monitoring</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Are fluent in English and French</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Are a master of portfolio analytics and  forecasts at the micro level</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Are comfortable with SQL and ideally in R or Python</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Are analytical and structured, with a fact-based decision-making style</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Are willing to deeply change the insurance industry and challenge the status quo</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">For this role we are looking to hire within the <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://alan.com/en/careers/a/salary-equity">C1-D level range</a>. </p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2><strong>🌍 How we work</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Location:</strong> You must be legally eligible to work from France.</p></li>