oduction. You can explain how they work and evaluate them. You know when a simple rule beats an agent, and AI coding tools are part of your daily work.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Range across the stack</strong>: comfortable across several languages and codebases, and quick to pick up new ones. Our stack is TypeScript, Rust and Ruby, on Google Cloud and Kubernetes with infrastructure as code. You don't need to be an SRE, but you deploy and run what you build and keep data correct as systems evolve</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Product sense and UX</strong>: you start from the problem, not the technology, and you care about the people using what you build and how it feels to use</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>High agency</strong>: you work across teams and switch context often, and you find the next problem worth solving and own it without waiting to be told</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>French and English</strong>: fluent French to work with our advisory team and the rest of the company, and professional English</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Based in Western Europe</strong>: we expect quarterly presence for our onsite weeks in Paris</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're particularly interested in:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">An agentic system you built that is in production and used today</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">How you know it works, and what it saves the people using it</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A time you chose a simple script or rule over an agent, and why</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul></li></ul><h2>Nice to have</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Familiarity with fintech or a regulated industry</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Passion for personal finance and investing</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><h2>What we offer</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Competitive salary:</strong> €65k - €80k base depending on experience, plus stock options</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Hybrid setup</strong>: teammates across France and Europe, with one week together in Paris every quarter (travel and accommodation covered)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Closeness to your users</strong>: you're part of the Operations team, work across advisory, sales, operations and engineering, and have direct access to the people using what you build from day one</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>High-performing environment</strong>: A-players who challenge you and help you grow</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Impact that compounds</strong>: what you build today makes every team more effective tomorrow</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><hr><p>Compensation: €65K – €80K • Offers Equity</p><ul><li> • Base salary €65K – €80K • Offers Equity</li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/finary/ai-product-engineer-paris-212944","tags":["Operations"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Remote","created_at":1793115632},{"slug":"stage-monteur-video-paris-365647","company_name":"Finary","title":"Stage - monteur vidéo","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Monte des vidéos vues par des centaines de milliers de personnes</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">La chaîne YouTube de Finary, c’est plus de 880 000 abonné·es, 5 à 10 millions de vues par mois et deux vidéos longues chaque semaine. C’est l’une des premières chaînes de finances personnelles en France. Elle produit aussi Finary Talk, notre émission d’interviews avec des entrepreneur·ses, des fiscalistes et des investisseur·ses.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Ton rôle</strong><br />Tu rejoins une équipe