 you, you'll be surrounded by people pushing that frontier every day.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Read more about our values <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://finarywealth.notion.site/About-Finary-2f5919045b5d8060afd1d4e887ac550f?pvs=143">here</a>.</p><h2>Context: where you'd have impact</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Finary (YC W21, 25M€ Series B) is building the leading wealth management platform in Europe. Some numbers:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>1M+ users</strong> on the platform</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A YouTube channel with <strong>850k+ subscribers and 5-10M monthly views</strong>, our main acquisition engine</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Finary One</strong>, our private offering for 1M€+ portfolios, growing fast</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our #1 growth challenge: <strong>converting our 1M+ users into paying subscribers</strong> to drive revenue. </p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our #2: feeding <strong>qualified leads to Finary One</strong> through content and growth work. The growth team today is 2 people plus AI agents doing the work of many more. </p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Everything you ship moves a metric someone looks at weekly. </p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Nothing you do will be "intern work" that sits in a drawer.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>About the role</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will join as a Growth Intern with a hybrid scope: hands-on growth execution across channels, plus data and automation work that makes the whole team faster. The team is AI-native: we automate everything that can be automated and spend our time on what moves the needle. This is not a "watch and learn" internship. You ship from week 1.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>Missions</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Growth execution</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Create and manage 