nfident and polished communicator able to build&nbsp;strong and lasting relationships</p></li><li><p>You are autonomous, do not hesitate to share new ideas with the team, and are genuinely interested in learning your customer's needs</p></li><li><p>You are located in a&nbsp;+/- 6h from CEST Timezone</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Why join CrowdSec?</strong></p><ul><li><p>You want to take part in an adventure with a bleeding edge tech startup</p></li><li><p>Work with a team of blackbelt pros in their fields and interact with an exciting community</p></li><li><p>You are driven and energetic, with a passion for prospecting and driving pipeline</p></li><li><p>We are a full-remote company, we meet twice a year to strengthen the team spirit during a 1-week seminar.</p></li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/crowdsec/remote-sales-account-executive-cybersecurity-montrouge-23147","tags":["Remote"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Remote job","created_at":1793105494},{"slug":"benevole-developpeur-testeur-dapplication-association-startup-de-tech-solidaire-teletravail-montpellier-45193","company_name":"LA FAMILLE MAGHEN","title":"Bénévole Développeur Testeur d’Application- Association Startup de Tech Solidaire - Télétravail","description":"<h2>Ce que vous allez accomplir</h2><p>Vous rejoignez une association de tech solidaire pour concevoir, tester et développer nos applications d'inclusion sociale, notamment sur le projet e-PhotoID. Vous participez à la phase de test, identifiez les anomalies et sécurisez la qualité de nos solutions numériques destinées à lutter contre la fracture numérique.</p><h2>Ce que nous attendons de vous</h2><ul><li><p>Un engagement bénévole de 10 heures par semaine en télétravail total, adapté à votre rythme.</p></li><li><p>Une formation en développement