etting an answer fast. They're about getting one people can trust.</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We believe trust is essential to how society works. Every day, we rely on information that's been independently verified, from financial statements to the products we buy, to the sustainability claims companies make. Behind that trust are audit and finance professionals who examine evidence, verify information and hold organizations accountable.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At DataSnipper, we build AI solutions that empower those professionals. By making evidence easier to trace and verify, we help them focus on the judgment and expertise that make their work so important.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>For our product and engineering team, this is where things get exciting.</strong> In audit, a plausible answer isn't good enough. Every output has to be explainable and traceable back to its source. We've just launched a brand new agentic platform, Alwin by DataSnipper. AI agents running in the cloud across hundreds of documents at once, reasoning across PDF, Word and Excel, with a full audit trail behind every step. There are lots of greenfield problems ahead, and real room to shape what we build and how we build it.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">And we build at scale. More than <strong>600,000 professionals across 3,000+ organizations in 175 countries</strong> rely on DataSnipper, including Fortune 500 companies, government agencies and all Big Four audit firms. In 2025 alone, the DataSnipper platform delivered more than <strong>$1.4 billion in productivity savings to is customers</strong>. Backed by a $100 million Series B led by Index Ventures, at a $1 billion valuation, and as proud members of 1% for the Planet, we care about how we grow, not just how fast.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">If you want to build AI that professionals trust with work that really matters, <em>this is your chance to help shape the future of audit and finance and do the best work of your career along the way.</em></p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2>What you will do</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead the design, implementation, and maintenance of highly available and scalable infrastructure on Azure</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Architect and automate CI/CD pipelines to enable rapid and reliable software delivery</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Coach teams on reliability best practices</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Implement advanced monitoring and alerting solutions using tools such as Prometheus and Grafana</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Orchestrate containerized workloads using Kubernetes for optimal resource utilization and scalability</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Develop IAC templates using Terraform to provision and manage cloud resources</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2>What you will bring</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2>What We Offer</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Be part of one of the<strong> fastest-growing, profitable unicorn scale-ups</strong> in the Netherlands with a global impact</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Equity (Stock Appreciation Rights) to share the company's success and growth</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excellent salary package, competitive for top tech talent</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Pension plan with a 6% contribution on top of your base salary</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">28 vacation days per year (full-time) to support your work-life balance</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hybrid work model with at least 3 days onsite in our dynamic Amsterdam office</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Daily, freshly prepared lunches by our